      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Full-opacity muted orange disabled state; the owner explicitly deferred Cal.com setup. Enabled hover is defined in source.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-booking\" disabled>Book a call<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-booking{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:28px;min-height:52px;padding:14px 24px;border:1px solid #ff6b35;border-radius:2px;background:#ff6b35;color:#05060a;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.015em;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Space Grotesk\"),sans-serif;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s,transform .2s}.ds-booking:disabled{cursor:default;background:#d77845;border-color:#d77845}.ds-booking:not(:disabled):hover{background:#ff8458;border-color:#ff8458;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-booking:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ff6b35;outline-offset:6px;}.ds-booking svg{transition:transform .2s}.ds-booking:not(:disabled):hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-booking,.ds-booking svg{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
